{"unit_id":"MojtabaFaraji__dsh-plugin-rtl-text#feature-1","repo":"MojtabaFaraji/dsh-plugin-rtl-text","commit":"df0444aecd33b16b473a220a89cf567ab1f0458d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-rtl-text 的功能「段落方向修正」：聊天文本块默认按 Unicode 首个强字符确定方向；英文开头但波斯语词较多或以波斯语结束的块会固定为 RTL。 由页面注入脚本自动处理聊天内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:32-170"]}
{"unit_id":"MojtabaFaraji__dsh-plugin-rtl-text#feature-2","repo":"MojtabaFaraji/dsh-plugin-rtl-text","commit":"df0444aecd33b16b473a220a89cf567ab1f0458d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-rtl-text 的功能「列表与引用布局」：聊天中的列表、引用和表格容器按内容决定方向，使项目符号、编号、引用线及列顺序随 RTL 内容移动。 由页面注入脚本自动处理聊天内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:32-170"]}
{"unit_id":"MojtabaFaraji__dsh-plugin-rtl-text#feature-3","repo":"MojtabaFaraji/dsh-plugin-rtl-text","commit":"df0444aecd33b16b473a220a89cf567ab1f0458d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-rtl-text 的功能「混合代码方向处理」：行内代码、键盘与链接等文本按词数多数方向隔离；代码块固定为 LTR，避免继承 RTL 容器方向。 由页面注入脚本自动处理聊天内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:32-170"]}
